Metadata-Version: 2.1
Name: greenlet
Version: 3.2.0
Summary: Lightweight in-process concurrent programming (WeavePy's bundled native implementation).
Home-page: https://greenlet.readthedocs.io/
License: MIT AND Python-2.0
Classifier: Programming Language :: Python :: 3.13
Requires-Python: >=3.9
Description-Content-Type: text/x-rst

This is WeavePy's bundled greenlet distribution (RFC 0066 WS4): the
upstream API implemented natively inside the interpreter over real
stack switching. A pip-installed cp313 greenlet wheel cannot work
under WeavePy (its hand-written assembly switches CPython's C stack),
so this dist-info marks the requirement as satisfied for
importlib.metadata, pip's resolver, and dependents such as
SQLAlchemy's asyncio extension.
